 "remarks": "Discover comfort, convenience, and style in this spacious 2-bedroom townhouse featuring generous closet space and two assigned garage parking spaces located directly beneath the home. Set within a beautifully maintained community, the property features a newly paved driveway and professional landscaping that create an inviting setting.  Freshly painted throughout, the home also features new light fixtures, a new washer and dryer, a newly remodeled kitchen, and a brand-new energy-efficient HVAC system-offering modern comfort, peace of mind, and improved efficiency. Security Ring camera system included.   Perfectly situated just minutes from The SoNo Collection, popular SoNo restaurants, vibrant nightlife, and plenty of entertainment and activities, this location puts everything within easy reach. Commuters will appreciate convenient access to I-95 or the Merrit Parkway making travel throughout Fairfield County and beyond a breeze.  Spacious, updated, and move-in ready, this townhouse offers an ideal combination of comfort, convenience, and location. A must-see!",
